<title>NETHERLANDS: AND BUYS CAMBRIDGE DATABASE.</title>
<headline>AND BUYS CAMBRIDGE DATABASE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Software and electronic publishing group AND Interternational Publishers Plc said on Wednesday it had bought the encyclopaedia database of Cambridge University Press.</p>
<p>AND added that Cambridge University Press would retain the publication rights of the printed version of the single-volumme Cambridge Encyclopaedia.</p>
<p>AND, whose shares are listed both in London and Amsterdam, will sell licences of the English language data in electronic form and translate the data into other languages for print and electronic use. No financial details of the deal were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
